zh-CN">串联起困在桎梏里的你我灵魂</span></p><p begin="39.057" end="41.486" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.057" end="39.223">Po</span><span begin="39.223" end="39.397">si</span><span begin="39.397" end="39.679">tive</span> <span begin="39.679" end="40.004">life</span> <span begin="40.004" end="40.216">sa</span><span begin="40.216" end="40.370">cri</span><span begin="40.370" end="40.678">fice</span> <span begin="40.678" end="40.859">what</span> <span begin="40.859" end="40.973">it</span> <span begin="40.973" end="41.187">is</span> <span begin="41.187" end="41.323">to</span> <span begin="41.323" end="41.486">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">积极人生于我，便是甘愿赴身</span></p><p begin="41.300" end="44.061" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.300" end="41.659">Our</span> <span begin="41.659" end="41.842">his</span><span begin="41.842" end="42.098">tory,</span> <span begin="42.309" end="42.623">on</span><span begin="42.623" end="42.788">ly</span> <span begin="42.788" end="42.947">a</span> <span begin="42.947" end="43.102">quar</span><span begin="43.102" end="43.245">ter</span> <span begin="43.245" end="43.400">of</span> <span begin="43.400" end="43.614">a</span> <span begin="43.614" end="43.809">cen</span><span begin="43.809" end="43.925">tu</span><span begin="43.925" end="44.061">ry</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们的过往，不过四分之一世纪光阴</span></p><p begin="44.061" end="46.684" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.061" end="44.263">Re</span><span begin="44.263" end="44.408">a</span><span begin="44.408" end="44.505">li</span><span begin="44.505" end="44.661">ty,</span> <span begin="44.866" end="45.042">sit</span><span begin="45.042" end="45.216">ting</span> <span begin="45.216" end="45.384">on</span> <span begin="45.384" end="45.539">the</span> <span begin="45.539" end="45.703">shoul</span><span begin="45.703" end="45.883">ders</span> <span begin="45.883" end="45.999">of</span> <span begin="45.999" end="46.181">our</span